"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"SiRC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"dabfe8e2-7380-4e0b-851f-03c62aa1a1c4","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"Goで特定のテストのためだけのフォーマットとパーサーがあったときにはさすがにびっくりした","ts":"1635308476.330200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"O+qrI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"19edbcc6-a987-41df-bcc5-9b22bf64fc16","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"つよいプログラマみんなパーサー書く","ts":"1635308463.329900","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":1,"users":["U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"T9kZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"59ec3e10-2b3b-49f0-a608-bf2501ea35e6","type":"message","user":"U02BDFBM620","text":"BNFがあるので，markdownパーサーとかに比べれば，愚直に書くだけ","ts":"1635308062.328800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":2,"users":["U9S4G0LJW","UL6CFN8NR"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bgQB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7c7c7bdf-4ee9-437e-b530-935667647098","type":"message","user":"U02BDFBM620","text":"パフォーマンスさえ気にしなければ，RFC8259 (JSON)は結構シンプル \u003chttps://gist.github.com/tani/f85bb4aac22f68c3ab5e84534b691b90\u003e\n\n```using PEG\n\n#================================================================\nJSON(RFC8259)\n================================================================#\n@rule json_text = json_ws \u0026amp; json_value \u0026amp; json_ws \u0026gt;\u0026gt;\u0026gt; (x, y, z)-\u0026gt;y\n@rule json_begin_array = json_ws \u0026amp; \"¥u005B\" \u0026amp; json_ws\n@rule json_begin_object = json_ws \u0026amp; \"¥u007B\" \u0026amp; json_ws\n@rule json_end_array = json_ws \u0026amp; \"¥u005D\" \u0026amp; json_ws\n@rule json_end_object = json_ws \u0026amp; \"¥u007D\" \u0026amp; json_ws\n@rule json_name_separator = json_ws \u0026amp; \"¥u003A\" \u0026amp; json_ws\n@rule json_value_separator = json_ws \u0026amp; \"¥u002C\" \u0026amp; json_ws\n@rule json_ws = r\"[¥u0020¥u0009¥u000A¥u000D]*\"\n@rule json_false = \"¥u0066¥u0061¥u006C¥u0073¥u0065\"\n@rule json_null = \"¥u006E¥u0075¥u006C¥u006C\"\n@rule json_true = \"¥u0074¥u0072¥u0075¥u0065\"\n@rule json_value = json_false | json_null | json_true | json_object | json_array | json_number | json_string\n@rule json_object = json_begin_object \u0026amp; (json_member[1] \u0026amp; (json_value_separator \u0026amp; json_member \u0026gt;\u0026gt;\u0026gt; (x, y)-\u0026gt;y)[*] \u0026gt;\u0026gt;\u0026gt; vcat)[?] \u0026amp; json_end_object \u0026gt;\u0026gt;\u0026gt; (x, y, z)-\u0026gt;Dict([y;[[]]][1])\n@rule json_member = json_string \u0026amp; json_name_separator \u0026amp; json_value \u0026gt;\u0026gt;\u0026gt; (x, y, z)-\u0026gt;(x, z)\n@rule json_array = json_begin_array \u0026amp; (json_value[1] \u0026amp; (json_value_separator \u0026amp; json_value \u0026gt;\u0026gt;\u0026gt; (x, y)-\u0026gt;y)[*] \u0026gt;\u0026gt;\u0026gt; vcat)[?] \u0026amp; json_end_array \u0026gt;\u0026gt;\u0026gt; (x, y, z)-\u0026gt;[y;[[]]][1]\n@rule json_number = json_minus[?] \u0026amp; json_int[1] \u0026amp; json_frac[?] \u0026amp; json_exp[?] \u0026gt;\u0026gt;\u0026gt; vcat \u0026gt;\u0026gt; join \u0026gt;\u0026gt; parse\n@rule json_decimal_point = \"¥u002E\"\n@rule json_digit = r\"[¥u0030-¥u0039]\"\n@rule json_digit1_9 = r\"[¥u0031-¥u0039]\"\n@rule json_e = r\"[¥u0065¥u0045]\"\n@rule json_exp = json_e[1] \u0026amp; (json_minus | json_plus)[?] \u0026amp; json_digit[+] \u0026gt;\u0026gt;\u0026gt; vcat \u0026gt;\u0026gt; join\n@rule json_frac = json_decimal_point[1] \u0026amp; json_digit[+] \u0026gt;\u0026gt;\u0026gt; vcat \u0026gt;\u0026gt; join\n@rule json_int = json_zero | json_digit1_9[1] \u0026amp; json_digit[*] \u0026gt;\u0026gt;\u0026gt; vcat \u0026gt;\u0026gt; join\n@rule json_minus = \"¥u002D\"\n@rule json_plus = \"¥u002B\"\n@rule json_zero = \"¥u0030\"\n@rule json_string = json_quotation_mark \u0026amp; json_char[*] \u0026amp; json_quotation_mark \u0026gt;\u0026gt;\u0026gt; (x, y, z)-\u0026gt;join(y)\n@rule json_char = json_unescaped | json_escape \u0026amp; r\"[¥u0022¥u005C¥u002F¥u0062¥u0066¥u006E¥u0072¥u0074]|¥u0075[0-9a-fA-F]{4}\" \u0026gt;\u0026gt;\u0026gt; (x, y)-\u0026gt;parse(\"\"\" \"$(x * y)\" \"\"\")\n@rule json_escape = \"¥u005C\"\n@rule json_quotation_mark = \"¥u0022\"\n@rule json_unescaped = r\"[^¥u0000-¥u001F¥u0022¥u005C]\" # [¥u0020-¥u0021¥u0023-¥u005B¥u005D-¥u0010FFFF]\n\nparse(s) = parse_whole(json_text, s)```","ts":"1635307924.328000","edited":{"user":"U02BDFBM620","ts":"1635308136.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"subara","count":2,"users":["U9S4G0LJW","U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+Kf3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"83c5fce3-889b-4093-ace4-d54770ae3028","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"freenode...","ts":"1635306308.326900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9Lwq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"91aa7e6b-ae99-4249-a278-8a6716d12fb7","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"IRC…","ts":"1635306258.326700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0Gj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"143b0881-2d79-4678-90b2-877d79fb0e36","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"コンパイル時 FizzBuzz","ts":"1635306113.326400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"66gR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d5bf960d-3c33-41cd-bd19-917a7f08575a","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"kazuho さんのコードで好きなやつこれ。 \u003chttps://labs.cybozu.co.jp/blog/kazuho/archives/2008/04/fizzbuzz_cpp_template.php\u003e","ts":"1635306105.326200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"KsF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4bec5872-8634-40d1-a4a4-299812cb1de1","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"kazuho さん、昔 IRC で深夜に「stl と親和性のある json パーサ